    "name": "iron_chain_lantern_support_by_axis", 
    "description": "LanternBlock.canSurvive needs the chain's face support shape to cover the 2x2 centre. A vertical chain spans the whole block so a lantern hangs below it and stands on top of it; a horizontal chain (axis x or z) floats mid-block and does not touch the block face, so the hanging lantern is destroyed. Removing a vertical chain also destroys the lantern below.", 
